  },
  "blocks": [
   {
    "id": "intro-title",
    "type": "heading",
    "sourceIds": [
     "deckweft-source"
    ],
    "text": "一页内容要经过四个部分，按固定顺序，才成为文件。"
   },
   {
    "id": "intro-body",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "sourceIds": [
     "deckweft-source"
    ],
    "text": "本文稿只讲解一个对象：DeckWeft 自己的导出流程。下一页先提出一个问题并给出回答，再让你把每个部分与整体对照着查看。"
   },
   {
    "id": "pipeline-question",
    "type": "heading",
    "sourceIds": [
     "deckweft-source"
    ],
    "text": "一页 DeckWeft 内容如何变成可以交付的文件？"
   },
   {
    "id": "pipeline-answer",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "sourceIds": [
     "deckweft-source"
    ],
    "text": "它按固定顺序经过四个部分：测量、修复、审阅和导出。在任何一个部分未通过的页面，都不会进入下一个部分。"
   },
   {
    "id": "pipeline-diagram",
    "type": "diagram",
    "sourceIds": [
     "deckweft-source"
    ],
    "diagramType": "process",
    "nodes": [
     {
      "id": "measure",
      "label": "测量"
     },
     {
      "id": "repair",
      "label": "修复"
     },
     {
      "id": "review",
      "label": "审阅"
     },
     {
      "id": "export",
      "label": "导出"
     }
    ],
    "edges": [
     {
      "id": "measure-to-repair",
      "from": "measure",
      "to": "repair"
     },
     {
      "id": "repair-to-review",
      "from": "repair",
      "to": "review"
     },
     {
      "id": "review-to-export",
      "from": "review",
      "to": "export"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "pipeline-source",
    "type": "citation",
    "sourceIds": [
     "deckweft-source"
    ],
    "sourceId": "deckweft-source",
    "text": "DeckWeft 代码库 · 导出顺序与质量循环"
   },
   {
    "id": "close-title",
    "type": "heading",
    "sourceIds": [
     "deckweft-source"
    ],
    "text": "被拒绝的导出会指明是哪个部分拒绝了它。"
   },
   {
    "id": "close-body",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "sourceIds": [
     "deckweft-source"
    ],
    "text": "每次拒绝都带有代码，例如 EXPORT_NOT_READY 或 BLUEPRINT_STATIC_REQUIRED，作者因此知道再次尝试前要修正哪个部分。"
   }
  ],
  "datasets": [],
  "sources": [
   {
    "id": "deckweft-source",
    "title": "DeckWeft 源代码：导出顺序（src/targets/export-order.mjs）与质量循环（docs/en/visual-quality.md）",
    "url": "https://github.com/FeidaWang/DeckWeft"
   }
  ],
  "explanations": [
   {
    "id": "pipeline-whole",
    "label": "DeckWeft 导出流程",
    "text": "四个部分按固定顺序排列。每个部分只接收前一部分已通过的内容，因此未经测量或未经审阅的页面不会成为文件。",
    "sourceIds": [
     "deckweft-source"
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "part-measure",
    "label": "测量",
    "text": "浏览器在字体和图片就绪后绘制每一页，并在 1440、1024 和 390 像素下测量版面、对比度与缺字。",
    "sourceIds": [
     "deckweft-source"
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "part-repair",
    "label": "修复",
    "text": "未通过的页面得到一次有界修正，只改动这一页。连续两轮仍未通过时，保留最后一个有效版本。",
    "sourceIds": [
     "deckweft-source"
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "part-review",
    "label": "审阅",
    "text": "有人查看实际截取的图像并记录发现，包括最弱的一页，之后才允许导出。",
    "sourceIds": [
     "deckweft-source"
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "part-export",
    "label": "导出",
    "text": "PowerPoint 与 PDF 遵循同一顺序：就绪、静态状态、冻结、停止动效、显示、渲染，最后读回文件进行检查。",
    "sourceIds": [
     "deckweft-source"
    ]
   }
  ],
